Subject: [PATCH 3/5] [ONNX] Matmul and Slice Layer fix to infer ONNX Models

Matmul Layer: Kernel performing dot operation accepts tensors having channel size only one. Hence a condition statement is added to matmul layer to perform required reshaping steps before and after performing the dot op.
Slice Layer: .setTensorDim is added to set TensorDim.

**Self evaluation:**
1. Build test: [*]Passed [ ]Failed [ ]Skipped
2. Run test: []Passed [ ]Failed [*]Skipped

